{"publicId":"c6a72816-3ae5-48e5-878f-1b75848edd7b","title":"现代Stockfish引擎在Pentium Pro上击败1996年Crafty引擎","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-03T07:56:21.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-03T07:56:21.000Z","digest":"语言模型开发者通过修改Stockfish和Crafty引擎，使现代Stockfish在1996年Pentium Pro（200MHz/64MB）上以78胜17平5负击败运行在现代硬件的1996年Crafty引擎。实验采用自定义接口，限制单步思考时间为1或10秒，Elo评分提升至2718±34（1秒）和2974±74（10秒）。Crafty作为1996年顶尖引擎，其现代硬件版本仍被旧硬件+现代引擎组合超越，但实验未解决硬件性能差异对结果的影响。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-03T11:55:46.528Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"基于1996年Pentium Pro的算法优化，现代国际象棋引擎可击败卡斯帕罗夫","latestReport":{"id":"slfrb3q0563cob0l53hvxn9kz"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fb2qYCoYAzzk","title":"使用1996年的Pentium Pro和现代Stockfish引擎击败1996年的Crafty引擎","firstReportAt":"2026-11-03T07:56:21.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"slfrb3q0563cob0l53hvxn9kz","title":"基于1996年Pentium Pro的算法优化，现代国际象棋引擎可击败卡斯帕罗夫","summary":"实验表明，1996年Pentium Pro（200MHz/64MB）运行改进版Stockfish引擎（Elo 3300±87）可击败卡斯帕罗夫（2800 Elo）。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T07:56:21.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"slfrb3q0563cob0l53hvxn9kz","title":"基于1996年Pentium Pro的算法优化，现代国际象棋引擎可击败卡斯帕罗夫","summary":"实验表明，1996年Pentium Pro（200MHz/64MB）运行改进版Stockfish引擎（Elo 3300±87）可击败卡斯帕罗夫（2800 Elo）。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T07:56:21.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","heat":5.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-04T06:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-04T07:00:00.000Z","heat":5.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-04T08:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-04T09:00:00.000Z","heat":4.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-04T11:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-04T12:00:00.000Z","heat":4.4,"part